    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "20 Famous Places to Visit in Korea :",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A Piece of Korean History: GyeongJu",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "또 다른 매력적인 여정으로 경상북도에 위치한 경주입니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Another attractive destination is GyeongJu located in South GyeongSang Province.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "경주는 신라왕국의 옛 수도였습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GyeongJu is the old capital of the Shilla Kingdom.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "신라왕국은 세 나라로 나누어진 나라에서 통일신라로 알려진 나라로 통일 되었습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Shilla Kingdom unified the divided land of Korea from three kingdoms into one that was known as the Unified Shilla Kingdom.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "신라왕국은 8세기동안 가장 영향력이 있었습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Shilla Kingdom was its most powerful during the eighth century.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "많은 사람들이 경주를 울타리가 없는 박물관으로 여깁니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Many people regard GyeongJu as a museum without walls.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "한국 사람들은 신라왕국의 많은 옛 유물들이 있기 때문에 그렇게 부릅니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Koreans refer to it as this because it contains many of the old remains of the Shilla Dynasty.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Shilla Kingdom unified the divided land of Korea from three kingdoms into one that was known as the Unified Shilla Kingdom",
      "lang": "en"
    }
  ],
